# ---- Real, org-specific data: never commit ----
# Wildcard-ignore every CSV anywhere in the repo (real inventories, driver maps, exports,
# etc.), then explicitly allowlist only the sanitized sample templates.
**/*.csv
!config/printers.sample.csv
!config/driver-map.sample.csv

# ---- Vendor driver payloads: proprietary/EULA-restricted, never commit ----
Drivers/**
!Drivers/README.md

# ---- Logs, exports, and other local run artifacts ----
*.log
*.log.*
PrinterManagement.log
*.xlsx
# Backup-PrinterState snapshots (real machine/printer names)
PrinterStateBackups/

# ---- OS/editor cruft and temp files ----
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
